1. a Goose checkout, Rust's handlers:
  goose asks: reserve Dict([("item", Str("book"))])
  goose asks: charge Dict([("user", Str("bob")), ("cents", Int(2000))])
  goose asks: log Dict([("line", Str("paid"))])
  rust log: paid
   its value: Int(7001)
2. a Goose resumable fn, its stops answered by Rust:
  goose asks: approve Dict([("cents", Int(100))])
  goose asks: approve Dict([("cents", Int(200))])
  goose asks: approve Dict([("cents", Int(300))])
   approved: Int(2)
3. a Rust checkout, the Goose shop's handlers:
   ann's book: Ok(101)
   bob's book: Ok(-1)
